./data/docling_include_vlm_52_2026-07-10_nolimits/markdown/june_update_2026_06_10_rec_000121.md:538:Figure 4: Ontology-grounded reward pipeline. Model outputs first pass through rule and safety guards, then enter a dual-judge semantic engine comprising an ontology-aware Answer Judge and a conditional Reasoning Judge (top). The lower panels detail template matching, semantic mapping, conditional switching, and multi-dimensional reasoning audit modules that implement label extraction, semantic grounding, gating, and weighted reasoning-quality scoring. Defense layer details are in Appendix A.4.
