./data/living_catalog/taxonomy_rerun_preflight_2026-08-12/taxonomy/runs/classification_dense/shard_02/records/july_update_2026-07-06__rec_000050_23824e963093/july_update_2026_07_06_rec_000050_23824e963093_docling_json_20260812_220205/docling/document.md:874:- Protein RL : 1 × H200, walltime up to 7 days per run with automatic checkpointing and requeueing. The reported warm-start β = 10 -4 sweep comprises 8 runs, corresponding to the protein RL results in Figure 4. Each training run chains two GPU evaluation jobs, one for the ID split and one for the OOD split, with sampling at T = 0 . 7 . We did not include the exploratory β = 10 -3 and no-warm-start protein RL runs in the reported results, so they are excluded from the compute accounting here.
